350
00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:22.389
Okay, we're both ready. Lay it on me.

351
00:20:25.309 --> 00:20:27.477
Roy Kent has been the best player
on every team he's been on

352
00:20:27.561 --> 00:20:28.896
