that all this ain't about winning to me.

399
00:23:05.719 --> 00:23:07.387
'Cause that ain't
how we measure success, right?

400
00:23:07.471 --> 00:23:08.847
Damn it, it is!

401
00:23:13.352 --> 00:23:16.855
Hey. Who put a firecracker
